{"id":"2358189876","kind":"answer","title":"该不该逼着孩子学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"我永远不会送我的孩子去学校","date":"2022-02-21","updated":"2022-02-21","votes":18,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":737,"keywords":["学习动机","学习内驱力","自主学习","强制学习","习得性无助"],"summary":"不应该 逼孩子学习会导致以下问题： 强迫抑制了学习内驱力 [1] ，从而导致长期学习的减少 强迫会导致丧失区分好的学习和不好的学习的能力(参见：网络战争 [2] ) 强迫会导致毒性记忆 [3] 的形成，这可能是行为、精神或神经障碍的前奏。 强迫会导致习得性无助 [4] ，这可能是抑郁的前奏。 强迫忍受不良的学习习惯可能会破坏未…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/391041543/answer/2358189876","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"不应该"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">不应该</h2><p data-pid=\"MYH4_Gql\">逼孩子学习会导致以下问题：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"N4zKSlfx\">强迫抑制了学习内驱力<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，从而导致长期学习的减少</li><li data-pid=\"b2FNf91q\">强迫会导致丧失区分好的学习和不好的学习的能力(参见：网络战争<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>)</li><li data-pid=\"zIk66Mdw\">强迫会导致毒性记忆<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>的形成，这可能是行为、精神或神经障碍的前奏。</li><li data-pid=\"7pbLBSgq\">强迫会导致习得性无助<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，这可能是抑郁的前奏。</li><li data-pid=\"XmZEdjoG\">强迫忍受不良的学习习惯可能会破坏未来的认知能力(参见：无语义学习<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>)</li><li data-pid=\"ed9T7Zsm\">强迫导致知识模型的瓦解<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></li></ul><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-e432e5cd2bf2653a64d4297ef77cb59c_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"368\" data-image-width=\"500\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">叶峻峣：学习中的强迫</a><p data-pid=\"mRYbum3Q\">至于是否应该通过外部奖励来激励孩子学习，答案也是否定的：</p><p data-pid=\"cYAYVyQ-\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/John_Holt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">约翰•霍尔特</a>曾说过，你“无法从外部激励孩子”。一切好的知识都来自内心。他补充说：「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coercion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你可以威胁孩子，也可以贿赂孩子。</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>」正如《学习的乐趣<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>》一章所解释的那样，他在很大程度上是正确的。</p><p data-pid=\"kf69GX4N\">所有非基于知识的奖励或惩罚都可能因错误的条件反射而适得其反。这可能会导致学习内驱力<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的最终抑制。特别是，学校的成绩是一种激励因素，会带来<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Dangers_of_being_a_Straight_A_student\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">一系列的负面影响</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"HJ2J2UVL\">Alfie Kohn 在 1995 年发现：由外部诱因引发的动机不仅不如内在动机有效；它可能会<b>侵蚀人的内在动机</b>，即对自己正在做的事情的兴奋感</p><p data-pid=\"BBBSFxYe\">学习动机最好的非具体来源是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大量学习本身</a>。这反过来又需要大量的自由和时间。</p><p data-pid=\"_PJVdWVb\">良好的学习产生更多良好的学习。最好的燃料来自内心。</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c93ea384e2e900e49d665878ef643a0d_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"926\" data-image-width=\"1355\" data-tm-id=\"357893386\" href=\"#/post/357893386\">叶峻峣：我怎样才能外在地激励孩子?</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 神经网络战争 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"359658715\" href=\"#/post/359658715\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 毒性记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67390960\" href=\"#/post/67390960\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 学习内驱力与习得性无助 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"65899656\" href=\"#/post/65899656\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 无语义学习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"295053968\" href=\"#/post/295053968\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 大脑算法保护现实的模型 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"356977535\" href=\"#/post/356977535\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 学习中的强迫 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 学习的乐趣 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1578551193\" href=\"#/post/1578551193\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 做全优学生的危险 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"369391813\" href=\"#/post/369391813\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"369391813","title":"成为优等生的危险","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":499,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67390960","title":"9 毒性记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":227,"minutes":24,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"65899656","title":"7 学习内驱力与习得性无助","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":167,"minutes":11,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"295053968","title":"无语义学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":58,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"351872034","title":"学习中的强迫","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":57,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"52990626","title":"5 学校对学习内驱力的影响","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":90,"minutes":18,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"575245791","title":"习得性无助","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":235,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"67694020","title":"11 最佳推动区","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":18,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"64572381","title":"6 学习内驱力和奖励（6.11-6.16）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":62,"minutes":20,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"66279009","title":"8 教育与进化背道而驰","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":90,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1822707507","title":"重庆男子对 3 岁女儿实行「打击教育」，责骂「笨，什么都学不会」来激将女儿发奋，如何看待这种教育方式？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":28,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 28 赞同"},{"id":"2452443382","title":"如何看待中国高中的强制晚自习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1138,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 1138 赞同"},{"id":"2405711341","title":"学生们为什么会厌学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":53,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 53 赞同"},{"id":"2518112993","title":"「学这些干什么买菜又用不到」，是中国特有的反智主义，还是强压教育下必然出现的结果？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":872,"minutes":9,"reason":"相似问答 · 872 赞同"},{"id":"2953326692","title":"ChatGPT会对应试教育带来革命吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":278,"minutes":9,"reason":"相似问答 · 278 赞同"}]}